---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro"
import CheckPanel from "../components/CheckPanel.astro"
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "")
---
<Base title="Mene">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="triad">MENE · TEKEL · UPHARSIN</p>
      <h1>The writing on the wall for poisoned packages.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Find out in seconds whether your build contains a hijacked npm release. Warnings come from independent witnesses and are written to Arkiv, where nobody can quietly delete them.</p>
      <ul class="points">
        <li><strong>Private.</strong> Your lockfile is checked in this page. It is never uploaded.</li>
        <li><strong>Quorum-verified.</strong> A warning counts only when two of three witnesses confirm it.</li>
        <li><strong>Permanent.</strong> No account, company or registry can erase an advisory.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <CheckPanel />
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Latest advisories</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/wall`}>View all →</a>
    </div>
    <div id="latest">
      <div class="sk-list"><div class="sk"></div><div class="sk"></div><div class="sk"></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How Mene works</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="card"><p class="word">Mene</p><h3>Inscribed</h3><p>A witness publishes an advisory in the open OSV format. It's written to Arkiv as a readonly entity and sealed, so even its author can't delete it.</p><a href={`${base}/docs/data-contract`}>Data contract →</a></li>
      <li class="card"><p class="word">Tekel</p><h3>Weighed</h3><p>Other witnesses confirm or withdraw it. One hacked witness can neither invent a warning nor bury a real one.</p><a href={`${base}/docs/trust-model`}>Trust model →</a></li>
      <li class="card"><p class="word">Upharsin</p><h3>Divided</h3><p>Your lockfile, CLI or CI job matches it locally, tells you the safe version, and blocks the build until you fix it.</p><a href={`${base}/docs/action`}>Add to CI →</a></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="ci">
    <div>
      <h2>Block poisoned installs in CI</h2>
      <p class="muted">Add one step to your workflow. If a package in your lockfile has an active advisory, the job fails and lists the safe versions.</p>
      <p><a class="btn" href={`${base}/docs/action`}>Action docs</a> <a class="btn" href={`${base}/docs/cli`}>CLI</a></p>
    </div>
<pre><code id="ci-snippet">- uses: andrew1234-arch/Mene/action@main
  with:
    lockfile: package-lock.json</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section class="card witness-cta">
    <div>
      <h2>Run a witness</h2>
      <p class="muted">Security teams and maintainers can publish advisories and confirm others' straight from the browser with any Ethereum wallet.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row-actions"><a class="btn primary" href={`${base}/publish`}>Publish an advisory</a><a class="btn" href={`${base}/witnesses`}>Choose your witnesses</a></div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; padding: 3.5rem 0 2rem; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.9rem); }
  .lede { font-size: 1.12rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 54ch; }
  .points { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1.4rem 0 0; display: grid; gap: .5rem; }
  .points li { padding-left: 1.4rem; position: relative; }
  .points li::before { content: "✦"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--gold); font-size: .8rem; top: .2rem; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; padding-top: 2rem; } }
  .sec-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }
  .steps { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); }
  .word { font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0; }
  .ci { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 2rem; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .ci { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .witness-cta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 3rem; }
  .witness-cta h2 { margin-top: 0; }
</style>

<script>
  import { advCard, watchWall, route, errorHtml } from "../scripts/mene"
  const el = document.getElementById("latest")!
  watchWall(
    (w) => {
      const rows = w.statuses.filter((s) => s.status !== "WITHDRAWN").slice(0, 5)
      el.innerHTML = rows.length
        ? `<ul class="adv-list">${rows.map(advCard).join("")}</ul>`
        : `<div class="empty"><p><strong>The wall is clean.</strong></p><p class="muted">No active advisories from your witnesses. <a href="${route("publish")}">Publish one</a>.</p></div>`
    },
    (err, retry) => {
      el.innerHTML = errorHtml(err)
      el.querySelector("[data-retry]")?.addEventListener("click", retry)
    },
  )
</script>
